---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section
  id="certificates"
  class="reveal reveal-scale relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0908] shadow-2xl"
>
  <video
    src="/videos/Amiya-Room-Arknights.mp4"
    class="absolute inset-0 z-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40 blur-[1px] transition-transform duration-[10s] hover:scale-110"
    autoplay
    loop
    muted
    playsinline></video>

  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0A0908] via-[#0A0908]/60 to-transparent"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A0908] via-transparent to-transparent"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-15 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(18,16,16,0)_50%,rgba(0,0,0,0.1)_50%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,0,0,0.02),rgba(0,255,0,0.01),rgba(0,0,255,0.02))] bg-[length:100%_4px,3px_100%]"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative z-20 flex flex-col gap-12 p-8 md:flex-row md:items-center md:p-16 lg:p-24"
  >
    <div class="reveal-scale flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center">
      <div class="group relative">
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 opacity-20 blur transition duration-1000 group-hover:opacity-40 group-hover:duration-200"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-white/20 shadow-2xl"
        >
          <img
            src="/images/FullStackCertificate.webp"
            alt="Certificate Full Stack"
            class="w-full max-w-[320px] transition-all duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 translate-x-[-100%] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:translate-x-[100%]"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-500/50 bg-[#0A0908] px-4 py-2 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl"
        >
          <Icon
            name="tabler:award"
            class="animate-pulse text-blue-400"
            size={18}
          />
          <span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-white uppercase"
            >Best Project Award</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <p
        class="mt-10 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] text-blue-400/60 uppercase"
      >
        ID: #FS-2023-CERT-01
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex-[1.5] space-y-8 text-white">
      <header class="reveal reveal-right space-y-4 delay-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="h-1 w-1 animate-ping rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
          <h2
            class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-blue-400 uppercase"
          >
            Certified Credentials
          </h2>
        </div>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
          Full Stack <span class="font-light text-white/50 italic"
            >Developer</span
          >
        </h3>

        <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Culminé un programa intensivo de un año con honores. El enfoque fue la
          construcción de <span class="font-medium text-white"
            >arquitecturas escalables</span
          > y la resolución de problemas de negocio mediante software de alta fidelidad.
        </p>
      </header>

      <ul
        class="reveal reveal-right grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 delay-400 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:max-w-2xl"
      >
        {
          [
            { name: "Computer Science", icon: "tabler:cpu" },
            { name: "Core Layouts", icon: "tabler:brand-html5" },
            { name: "JavaScript Engine", icon: "tabler:brand-javascript" },
            { name: "Server Logic", icon: "tabler:database" },
            { name: "UI Frameworks", icon: "tabler:brand-react" },
            { name: "Deployment Flow", icon: "tabler:brand-github" },
          ].map((item) => (
            <li class="group flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.03] p-4 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-blue-500/5">
              <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 transition-colors group-hover:bg-blue-500/20">
                <Icon
                  name={item.icon}
                  class="text-xl text-blue-400/70 group-hover:text-blue-400"
                />
              </div>
              <span class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-wider text-slate-300 transition-colors group-hover:text-white">
                {item.name}
              </span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
